  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Support to the State Service for Maritime, Inland Waterway Transport and Shipping of Ukraine (Shipping Administration) in the Implementation of the EU Acquis, Norms and Standards on Maritime Safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the project is to ensure the implementation of Ukraine&apos;s international obligations in the field of port state, flag state and coastal state control, maritime education, and protection of human life at sea.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
